{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<h2>韓國café推焦糖蘋果冬甩 </h2>\n<p>最近韓國首爾新開的冬甩咖啡店「누도（NUDO）」，便憑一款焦糖蘋果冬甩在社交平台迅速走紅。薄切新鮮蘋果被一片片疊成盛放花朵的形狀，遠看根本不像冬甩，更像一件精緻的甜品藝術品。\n</p>\n<h2>賣相勁打卡</h2>\n<p>這款招牌蘋果冬甩以焦糖冬甩為底，外層包裹經醃製的蘋果片，再以螺旋方式層層疊起，視覺效果極為搶眼。蘋果口感柔軟，焦糖甜度不算過分。由於製作工序繁複，蘋果冬甩每日僅限量供應約20至30個。除了招牌蘋果冬甩，店內還有檸檬、紅桑子、無花果、開心果等多款口味。紅桑子冬甩以蛋白霜點綴，無花果冬甩則放上鮮果，每款都充滿設計感；經典NUDO冬甩則撒上奶粉，外層帶來微微脆口。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179472964833078090_13055966306af966b0c999c.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179472964833078090_13055966306af966b0c999c.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179472965070474552_2660235906af966b30e900.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179472965070474552_2660235906af966b30e900.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179472965256295810_19834729276af966b4f0b56.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179472965256295810_19834729276af966b4f0b56.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<blockquote><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/DfwGd2PE4Rw/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</a></p></blockquote>\n<p>\n</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T08:17:34.238115+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":383,"images":3,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T08:00:54+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T10:12:57.569534+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T08:11:30.931918+00:00","content_hash":"f4f1bc8c8819427ef8de2d0fdf5c23c4d0908916672908d68b2206534f202951","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}